# DefogDaily has no required configuration.
#
# Every part of the product — the eight-domain scan, the diagnostic report, the
# 28-day protocol, history, achievements — runs entirely in the browser with no
# backend and no account. You can clone this repo, `npm run dev`, and have the
# whole thing working without setting anything here.
#
# The single optional extra is the written coach briefing. Without a key, the
# Defog Coach panel still fills in with a briefing composed locally from the
# same report data; with one, /api/coach asks Claude to write it instead.
#
# This is a SERVER-side variable. It is read only inside api/coach.js and is
# never exposed to the browser — do not prefix it with VITE_, which would
# inline it into the client bundle for anyone to read.
#
# Local dev:  put it in .env.local (git-ignored)
# Vercel:     Project → Settings → Environment Variables

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="sk-ant-..."
